# arms/adult/action/onehand/sword_r: the near (right) arm of A3's sword swing, re-cut from the old pivot overlays (P2c
# SLICE-ARMS, 2026-10-23; STYLE_P2 25.7, P2C_CONTRACTS 2 and 4). Every view is A3's arm pixel for pixel (B1 16 / 16 at
# 0 px): the sleeve, the bracer and the fist, on A3's pivot origin and layer, with `mark grip` in the fist, where the
# blade (held/weapons/sword `a3<key>`, or a library angle a000..a337) hangs. Regions: U upper sleeve, F forearm, C the
# bracer, H the fist, so the guard's mail and the knight's plate recolour one drawing (regionsOf). Keys sw_<A3 key>:
# d0 coil, d1 sweep, d2 cut, d3 recover (and u, r, l). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role arms std
layer held
anchor pivot
keys armR
side R
z 1

