# (P2c slice i3) sw_blk: the shield bearer's block (STYLE_P2 25.8 item 7): the knees bent, the shield square to the threat
# and the sword drawn back low under it, the point forward (side views) or out and up at the right side (D, U); the fist marks
# grip, the blade is the library angle the clip names (weapon=0 / 180 / 157.5 / 22.5). The drawing is the spear block's
# low fist (twohand/spear_r sp_block), on the shoulder like the loco arms.
